// IntroString :
"P3155500430" "Them PPD have been snoopin' around too much in the tunnels lately. We can't even move around some supplies without runnin' into a group of 'em. It's a little dangerous, but we need someone to get into those tunnels and lower the PPD numbers a bit."
// AcceptString :
"P3256922155" "Fight the PPD in Underground Nova"
// SendOffString :
"P4255438936" "I got the info sent over to you now. All you gotta do is put the hurt on some PPD, like say, ten of 'em. That should give us some breathin' space to do what we gotta do in the tunnels."
// TaskTitle :
"P1723405766" "<font face=title><color orange>PPD BRINGING US DOWN IN THE TUNNELS</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P421636757" "Maybe now the Resistance will have some more room to move around in the tunnels."

