// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1777803819" "A group of Resistance got cornered in a warehouse in Imperial City and got their heads handed to 'em. Only problem was that they were carryin' maps of the tunnels with 'em. The PPD are swarmin' the scene now lookin' for any evidence. We gotta get someone in there to knock around the PPD and recover the map of them tunnels."
// AcceptString :
"P3886467058" "Recover the Underground Tunnel map."
// SendOffString :
"P4054280577" "I got the info sent over to you now. You gotta take down the PPD boys who're leadin' the investigation and recover that map of the tunnels! One thing we don't need is the PPD knowin' how to get around the tunnels to find us, you know?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P406243617" "Recover the Underground Tunnel map"
