"P1113323027" "Word on the street is that the PPD just did a big sweep through a Syndicate office. They beat them guys down somethin' silly, but we got word that there's some spare medical supplies that the Syndicate were usin' in that office. If we can get our hands on that stuff, we can use it to treat some of our injured. You up for this?"
// AcceptString :
"P2670884276" "Recover Syndicate Medical Supplies"
// SendOffString :
"P2979657329" "I got the info sent over to you now. You gotta recover any of the supplies you can and take down the PPD Squad leader hangin' around in there. We get those medical supplies and we're in it for the long haul. A healthy slammer is a happy slammer, you dig?"
