"P1773358509" "Those Destroyers are really causing us nothing but problems. We had an operation goin' on in a tech facility when they stormed the place and killed all of our boys! Last thing we heard is that they're tryin' to get info outta these mainframes we were tryin' to destroy. You gotta take down them mainframes and recover the body of the guy who was leadin' our boys in there!"
