// IntroString :
"P1774384056" "So you hear about how some groups of the Syndicate were workin' together with us? Well, one of 'em decided to be rotten backstabbers and turn on a group of us in the tunnels! Most of our boys got trashed, but at least one of 'em is left. Someone's gotta go down there and save that guy's hide and also deliver some sweet justice to them Syndicate boys."
// AcceptString :
"P1076902821" "Take the fight to the Syndicate"
