// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3874726168" "Looks like we got ourselves a traitor within the Resistance. This guy ratted out a bunch of us to the PPD and now an entire squad is on the run! We need someone to grab that traitor so we can stop him from talkin' about anythin' else we got planned!"
// AcceptString :
"P3908809742" "Bring in the Resistance Traitor"
// SendOffString :
"P1345598890" "I got the info sent over to you now. The traitor probably ain't gonna put up much of a fight, but we still gotta take down whoever is heading the investigation from the PPD and wipe their computers clean of any info that the traitor told 'em. Crazy stuff that we actually got betrayed, you know?"
// TaskTitle :
"P3726455300" "<font face=title><color orange>RESISTANCE TRAITOR MEETING WITH PPD</color></font>"

